# Placeholder so that //go:embed all:dist succeeds in a fresh checkout.
# `make web` fills this directory with the built panel.
#
# It lives in web/public/ rather than being written straight into dist:
# Vite empties the output directory on every build, but copies public/ back
# in afterwards. Keeping the tracked copy here means a release build leaves
# the working tree clean, which goreleaser requires.
